<title>SRI LANKA: John Keells 12-mth net up 27 pct.</title>
<headline>John Keells 12-mth net up 27 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of John Keells Holdings Ltd for the 12 months ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				  1997		  1996</p>
<p>    Turnover		5,720.81   vs     5,316.62</p>
<p>    Net profit		421.29   vs	 331.19</p>
<p>    Tax			 183.22   vs	 203.44</p>
<p>NOTE - Blue chip John Keells Holdings is one of three diversified conglomerates trading in Colombo. The company conslidates the accounts of over 61 companies, 14 of which are listed.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
